e received a power from the Great Demon King, but… \n\n“Great Demon King, no matter how much I think about it, there is a problem with my power.”\n“Problem?”\n\nAmong the Demon Kings with extraordinary abilities… Karos received the [Gacha] ability. \n\n“Gacha as the power of a Demon King? How am I supposed to rule the world with Gacha?!'”","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/888b469a-2903-4a03-b19b-f11a1c899862/9acda72f-ce9c-4cd0-a838-b0d12a320383.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","es","pt-br","es-la"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":6.68,"follows":1188,"listAt":"2026-10-27T05:13:55.735Z","chapters":[{"id":"08ebd388-32fd-4bb8-b403-7fc9df386290","number":"18","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2024-07-15T03:01:42+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"4ea08340-1915-426c-85eb-80feadf4e37e","number":"17","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2024-07-15T03:01:13+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"fa5a1f88-db25-4338-83b5-e76616827007","number":"16","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2024-06-28T21:56:50+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a7dc747c-9508-4085-a3bd-a59e3264076f","number":"15","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2024-06-28T21:55:13+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"11c529ba-803a-4ae3-96c4-1cd202bb9c31","number":"14","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2024-06-28T21:53:17+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0739281a-0847-44c8-9cd2-b5f9c9ab1a2e","number":"13","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2024-06-28T21:52:45+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b7458858-5f86-463c-aa6f-c3a6860159fd","number":"12","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":65,"createdAt":"2024-06-28T21:52:10+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8cd2132e-70de-406c-9fe0-9c6f50e597a8","number":"11","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en